    shape: L-bracket; NW has filled top-row + left-col; NE=flipLR(NW), SW=flipUD(NW), SE=flip_both(NW)
    alignment: NW/NE share rows, SW/SE share rows, NW/SW share cols, NE/SE share cols
    area: 3 for 2x2, 5 for 3x3
